  ## Description
  
  Detects suspicious cloud data gathering sequences tied to the Shai-Hulud objective.
  
  ## Deployment
  
  | Platform | Status | Strategy | Deployed by | Tenants | Block enabled |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | Microsoft Sentinel | `STAGING` | `PREVIEW` | PREVIEW runs | `staging` | yes |
  
  - `STAGING`: Under test on the staging tenant
  
  ### Tenant targeting
  
  | Platform | Tenant | Reached by | Remote ID |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | Microsoft Sentinel | `staging`<br>Pre-production workspace | PREVIEW runs | `rule-7f3a` |
  | Microsoft Sentinel | `production`<br>Production workspace | no run | - |
  
  ## Platform configuration
  
  ### Microsoft Sentinel
  
  **`query`** (KQL)
  
  ```kql
  AuditLogs
  | where OperationName has "List"
  | where Result =~ "success"
  | take 1
  ```
  
  | Setting | Value | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- |
  | `name` | `Shai-Hulud Sentinel Rule` | Platform-specific rule name. |
  | `scheduling.frequency` | `PT1H` | Duration: ISO 8601, or shorthand converted to ISO 8601. |
  | `scheduling.lookback` | `PT2H` | Duration: ISO 8601, or shorthand converted to ISO 8601. |
  | `alert.title` | `Shai-Hulud Sentinel Rule` | Alert display-name format. |
  | `alert.suppression` | `false` | `false` disables suppression and sends a one-hour duration. |
  | `alert.create_incident` | `true` *(default)* | Whether a firing alert opens an incident. |
  | `grouping.event` | `SingleAlert` | Sentinel `aggregationKind`. `SingleAlert` groups events into one alert. `AlertPerResult` emits one alert per row. |
  | `grouping.alert.enabled` | `false` | Group alerts into one incident. |
  | `entities[0].entity` | `Account` | Sentinel entity type (`Account`, `Host`, `IP`, `URL`, …). |
  
  **`entities[0].mappings`**: Column bindings for that entity.
  
  | `identifier` | `column` |
  | --- | --- |
  | `Name` | `Identity` |
  
  ## Response
  
  | Property | Value |
  | --- | --- |
  | Alert severity | High |
  | Playbook | PB-IR-001 |
  | Responders | soc_l1 |
  
  **Analysis**
  
  Validate whether cloud listing behavior matches approved automation.
  
  **Containment**
  
  Temporarily suspend suspicious account sessions and revoke tokens.
  
  **Search: Corroborate suspicious inventory calls** (Sentinel, KQL)
  
  ```kql
  AuditLogs
  | where OperationName has "List"
  | summarize count() by Identity
  ```
  
  ## ATT&CK techniques
  
  | Technique | Name | Tactics | Summary |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | [`T1589`](https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1589) | Gather Victim Identity Information | Reconnaissance | Adversaries may gather information about the victim's identity that can be used during targeting. |
  
